(239628, 15036, 806, '<td valign="top">good set up. nice pose and expression. great lighting. May I suggest a little tilt of her head to her right shoulder? Cutie.<br/>Also.. her features are a bit distorted...i.e. did you take this at a wider angle, or maybe you were too close to her? Not overly pronounced, but I noticed.</td>', 'good set up. nice pose and expression. great lighting. May I suggest a little tilt of her head to her right shoulder? Cutie.Also.. her features are a bit distorted...i.e. did you take this at a wider angle, or maybe you were too close to her? Not overly pronounced, but I noticed.', '2003-03-18 00:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
