(240161, 15115, 6328, '<td valign="top">Composition is nice and simple<br/>Idea is nice and original, Fits the Challenge<br/>Lighting is by day and hard to do anything with<br/>Focus looks okay<br/>Colours are fine<br/>I don''t think I would have put that weed in front of my photo though, would have pulled it out, and just put the sea of green in front.</td>', 'Composition is nice and simpleIdea is nice and original, Fits the ChallengeLighting is by day and hard to do anything withFocus looks okayColours are fineI don''t think I would have put that weed in front of my photo though, would have pulled it out, and just put the sea of green in front.', '2003-03-18 10:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(240163, 15131, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and wonderful use of negative space.  Lighting is terrific, as is your composition.  I like the border, but am bothered by the fact that essentially, only the upper half of the photo has a border since it blends right in with the negative space at the bottom. / OK, I''ve been looking at this for a while now, and after further consideration, I am not so bothered by the border issue because the leaves actually look like they are reaching out of the photo - almost a 3D look.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'Beautiful, and wonderful use of negative space.  Lighting is terrific, as is your composition.  I like the border, but am bothered by the fact that essentially, only the upper half of the photo has a border since it blends right in with the negative space at the bottom. / OK, I''ve been looking at this for a while now, and after further consideration, I am not so bothered by the border issue because the leaves actually look like they are reaching out of the photo - almost a 3D look.  I like this a lot.', '2003-03-18 10:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(240168, 15139, 6328, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Lots of choices of green here, aren\''t there?  I don\''t think I would have used a green border around me either.<br/>Composition is nice and simple<br/>Idea is nice and original, <br/>Fits the Challenge<br/>Lighting looks good, but there is one highlited area on the top \"classic\"<br/>Focus looks okay<br/>Colours are fine, but why the blue one?<br/>And I like your use of the 3rds.</td>', 'Hmm.  Lots of choices of green here, aren\''t there?  I don\''t think I would have used a green border around me either.Composition is nice and simpleIdea is nice and original, Fits the ChallengeLighting looks good, but there is one highlited area on the top \"classic\"Focus looks okayColours are fine, but why the blue one?And I like your use of the 3rds.', '2003-03-18 10:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(240169, 14985, 2553, '<td valign="top">Lots of dark shadows on my monitor, and the broccoli looks more yellow-brown-green than the bright green I would expect.  There seems to be a very small area that is in focus, and the rest is pretty fuzzy.   I do like the way the lighting lights up the stalk areas, and the little buds.</td>', 'Lots of dark shadows on my monitor, and the broccoli looks more yellow-brown-green than the bright green I would expect.  There seems to be a very small area that is in focus, and the rest is pretty fuzzy.   I do like the way the lighting lights up the stalk areas, and the little buds.', '2003-03-18 10:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(240170, 14964, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the part of the leaf on the left where you can see the tiny droplets and the beautiful color.  The rest of it has so much glare on it that it just pushes my eye to the left.</td>', 'I love the part of the leaf on the left where you can see the tiny droplets and the beautiful color.  The rest of it has so much glare on it that it just pushes my eye to the left.', '2003-03-18 10:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
