(240177, 14960, 6328, '<td valign="top">Composition is quite good; <br/>Meets the Challenge; <br/>Visual impact is great <br/>Focus is good, nice and sharp but a little more lighting could have provided more details towards the middle and bottom;<br/> Good idea for photo<br/> Colours are good, especialy the way you''ve captured the red around the white flame of the candle light.<br/>The only thing that bothers me is the brownish table color that then joins in with the black, very distracting, takes away from the green candle altogether.<br/></td>', 'Composition is quite good; Meets the Challenge; Visual impact is great Focus is good, nice and sharp but a little more lighting could have provided more details towards the middle and bottom; Good idea for photo Colours are good, especialy the way you''ve captured the red around the white flame of the candle light.The only thing that bothers me is the brownish table color that then joins in with the black, very distracting, takes away from the green candle altogether.', '2003-03-18 10:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
