(240207, 15126, 2553, '<td valign="top">For me, there is just too much going on in this shot.  My eyes wander all over looking for a place to "rest", and there really is no place.  The fennel seems to be in good focus, but it is still hard to pick it out of the confusing background.</td>', 'For me, there is just too much going on in this shot.  My eyes wander all over looking for a place to "rest", and there really is no place.  The fennel seems to be in good focus, but it is still hard to pick it out of the confusing background.', '2003-03-18 11:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(240209, 15006, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and good composition.  I would definitely liked to have seen some of the shadowy areas filled in with more light.</td>', 'Nice perspective and good composition.  I would definitely liked to have seen some of the shadowy areas filled in with more light.', '2003-03-18 11:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(240212, 15046, 2553, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen more light and less negative space.</td>', 'I would like to have seen more light and less negative space.', '2003-03-18 11:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(240213, 15116, 4536, '<td valign="top">This is nice, like the lighting and the crispness. One thing I don''t like is the white border blending into the picture.</td>', 'This is nice, like the lighting and the crispness. One thing I don''t like is the white border blending into the picture.', '2003-03-18 11:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(240215, 15150, 2553, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot, though it seems a little dark on my monitor.  I really would like to see the hearts a little brighter.</td>', 'Really like this shot, though it seems a little dark on my monitor.  I really would like to see the hearts a little brighter.', '2003-03-18 11:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(240217, 15032, 2553, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Very "artsy", and I really like it.  Composition works for me, and I like the dark blue background.</td>', 'Hmm.  Very "artsy", and I really like it.  Composition works for me, and I like the dark blue background.', '2003-03-18 11:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(240219, 15009, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice clear, well lit shot.  Moderate impact for me.</td>', 'Nice clear, well lit shot.  Moderate impact for me.', '2003-03-18 11:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(240220, 15011, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the border treatment.</td>', 'I love the border treatment.', '2003-03-18 11:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(240221, 15033, 2553, '<td valign="top">Moderate impact shot for me.  The background looks desaturated, and I am not crazy about that, I think a blue sky background would have had more impact.</td>', 'Moderate impact shot for me.  The background looks desaturated, and I am not crazy about that, I think a blue sky background would have had more impact.', '2003-03-18 11:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(240223, 15114, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp, clear shot.  I like the simplicity of it.</td>', 'Nice sharp, clear shot.  I like the simplicity of it.', '2003-03-18 11:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(240224, 14984, 6855, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2003-03-18 11:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(240225, 14960, 2553, '<td valign="top">Would really have liked to have seen some light on the details of the candle - it seems very dark to me.</td>', 'Would really have liked to have seen some light on the details of the candle - it seems very dark to me.', '2003-03-18 11:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(240226, 15144, 6855, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I almost did this, but I only had a wrinkled one a couple nickles in  my pocket!  I wish this was a little more "green" but I''m scoring you higher anyway, just for the creativity.</td>', 'LOL!  I almost did this, but I only had a wrinkled one a couple nickles in  my pocket!  I wish this was a little more "green" but I''m scoring you higher anyway, just for the creativity.', '2003-03-18 11:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(240228, 15008, 6855, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the lighting here!  This is a GREAT submission!</td>', 'I LOVE the lighting here!  This is a GREAT submission!', '2003-03-18 11:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(240229, 14960, 6855, '<td valign="top">The candle gives this sucjh a soft romantic glow - it does feel out of focus and a little tilted to me, but I still like the idea.</td>', 'The candle gives this sucjh a soft romantic glow - it does feel out of focus and a little tilted to me, but I still like the idea.', '2003-03-18 11:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(240231, 15012, 1, '<td valign="top">Almost yellow, but definitely some green to it.  The composure and lighting are both excellent.  I really can''t suggest any improvements.</td>', 'Almost yellow, but definitely some green to it.  The composure and lighting are both excellent.  I really can''t suggest any improvements.', '2003-03-18 11:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(240235, 15139, 6551, '<td valign="top">Great pic !!!!!!</td>', 'Great pic !!!!!!', '2003-03-18 11:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(240238, 15036, 3102, '<td valign="top">Hello Sonja!  This is one of my favorites for this challenge.  She''s a great model for you!</td>', 'Hello Sonja!  This is one of my favorites for this challenge.  She''s a great model for you!', '2003-03-18 11:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(240263, 15134, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool Idea. :)<br/>Check my Macro Challenge entry. :)</td>', 'Cool Idea. :)Check my Macro Challenge entry. :)', '2003-03-18 12:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(240266, 15033, 4136, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this photo will have already been bookmarked by half of the Canadian Irish before the week is up...</td>', 'I''m sure this photo will have already been bookmarked by half of the Canadian Irish before the week is up...', '2003-03-18 13:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(240268, 15149, 4136, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the competition... Alternating shades of green, dark lines, well cropped... Nicely done!</td>', 'My favorite of the competition... Alternating shades of green, dark lines, well cropped... Nicely done!', '2003-03-18 13:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(240269, 15036, 4136, '<td valign="top">Nicely done</td>', 'Nicely done', '2003-03-18 13:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(240272, 14958, 4136, '<td valign="top">Nice splash of red in the glass. I like the accent feature along the inside curves of the glass... Were those part of the glass or did you add salt?</td>', 'Nice splash of red in the glass. I like the accent feature along the inside curves of the glass... Were those part of the glass or did you add salt?', '2003-03-18 13:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(240273, 14984, 4136, '<td valign="top">What a really good idea... The lighting was a great idea, even if it was a little too bright near the upper right corner<br/></td>', 'What a really good idea... The lighting was a great idea, even if it was a little too bright near the upper right corner', '2003-03-18 13:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(240274, 14982, 4136, '<td valign="top">I personally would have liked the entire middle slice to be in focus. I like some of the wavy detail on the lower-right segments.</td>', 'I personally would have liked the entire middle slice to be in focus. I like some of the wavy detail on the lower-right segments.', '2003-03-18 13:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(240275, 15146, 6855, '<td valign="top">So cute and so clever!  One of my favorites.</td>', 'So cute and so clever!  One of my favorites.', '2003-03-18 13:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(240276, 15134, 6855, '<td valign="top">Now that''s alot of caps!  Hopefully, they''ve been collected over time, not just in the last hour, LOL! 8 from me.</td>', 'Now that''s alot of caps!  Hopefully, they''ve been collected over time, not just in the last hour, LOL! 8 from me.', '2003-03-18 13:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(240277, 15150, 4136, '<td valign="top">Very otherworldly</td>', 'Very otherworldly', '2003-03-18 13:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(240278, 15024, 6855, '<td valign="top">Your title is absolutely hilarious and the photo is great too!</td>', 'Your title is absolutely hilarious and the photo is great too!', '2003-03-18 13:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(240279, 15137, 6855, '<td valign="top">Great macro!</td>', 'Great macro!', '2003-03-18 13:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(240282, 15022, 6855, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Your DOF is incredible - this will probably be in the top 3.</td>', 'Awesome!  Your DOF is incredible - this will probably be in the top 3.', '2003-03-18 13:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
