(240866, 15034, 6328, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, nice idea for the photo<br/>Photo meets the Challenge<br/>Visual impact is pleasant<br/>Focus is good; Lighting looks fine<br/>Color seems to be just right<br/>The only problem is in cropping, you cut the girl''s feet off!  You should have left them in the photograph.  In a real competition, you would have lost serious points.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Composition is good, nice idea for the photoPhoto meets the ChallengeVisual impact is pleasantFocus is good; Lighting looks fineColor seems to be just rightThe only problem is in cropping, you cut the girl''s feet off!  You should have left them in the photograph.  In a real competition, you would have lost serious points. ', '2003-03-18 21:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
