(241396, 15039, 2667, '<td valign="top">This is not the best splash shot I have seen... looks as though it could have used sharper focus, or a faster shutter speed. But either way, it works great for this challenge, and it made me smile! Nice work.</td>', 'This is not the best splash shot I have seen... looks as though it could have used sharper focus, or a faster shutter speed. But either way, it works great for this challenge, and it made me smile! Nice work.', '2003-03-19 12:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(241401, 15128, 4411, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve managed to get a green background and it''s blurred out very nicely. The DoF is perfect with good detail on the bark, and the diagonals are very strong.<br/>The only thing I don''t like is the out of focus part on the left hand side - if I cover it with my hand I see a much better, cleaner shot.<br/>A good photo, and I do like it.</td>', 'I like that you''ve managed to get a green background and it''s blurred out very nicely. The DoF is perfect with good detail on the bark, and the diagonals are very strong.The only thing I don''t like is the out of focus part on the left hand side - if I cover it with my hand I see a much better, cleaner shot.A good photo, and I do like it.', '2003-03-19 12:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(241404, 15029, 4411, '<td valign="top">Can we have a tutorial on how you''ve cghanged the red to green please? ; )<br/>I have an idea of how it''s done, but I''ve never tried it, and this is done to perfection.<br/>It''s a good, clean, strong, simple image, something I like a lot, and the colours are great. The only thing I would change is to crop about half of the sky at the top off - I feel this would balance the image better.<br/>Great work, classic theme with a twist, well done.</td>', 'Can we have a tutorial on how you''ve cghanged the red to green please? ; )I have an idea of how it''s done, but I''ve never tried it, and this is done to perfection.It''s a good, clean, strong, simple image, something I like a lot, and the colours are great. The only thing I would change is to crop about half of the sky at the top off - I feel this would balance the image better.Great work, classic theme with a twist, well done.', '2003-03-19 12:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(241408, 15151, 4411, '<td valign="top">Needs a sharper pattern with more contrast for me.<br/>A good idea well executed though.</td>', 'Needs a sharper pattern with more contrast for me.A good idea well executed though.', '2003-03-19 12:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
