(241440, 15148, 7364, '<td valign="top">Good animal shot.  I hat shooting animals, who knows what they''re going to do next?  I don''t know what equipment you have but my critique of thsi photo would include comments about focusing on the subject, not letting peripheral objects interfere witht the subject, and colorization, the photo''s color is washed out.  With a little technical help, this could be a nice photo.</td>', 'Good animal shot.  I hat shooting animals, who knows what they''re going to do next?  I don''t know what equipment you have but my critique of thsi photo would include comments about focusing on the subject, not letting peripheral objects interfere witht the subject, and colorization, the photo''s color is washed out.  With a little technical help, this could be a nice photo.', '2003-03-19 13:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(241441, 15131, 7364, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice composition. The only negative (hopefullt constructive) thing I ahve to say is that the lighting is too harsh.  The subject would benefit from softer, more ambient lighting. Try to soften the shadows and reduce the sheen of the leaves.  Find a nice middle ground.</td>', 'This is a very nice composition. The only negative (hopefullt constructive) thing I ahve to say is that the lighting is too harsh.  The subject would benefit from softer, more ambient lighting. Try to soften the shadows and reduce the sheen of the leaves.  Find a nice middle ground.', '2003-03-19 13:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
