(242048, 15038, 7190, '<td valign="top">too out of focus</td>', 'too out of focus', '2003-03-20 09:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(242049, 14993, 7190, '<td valign="top">background distracting from strong images</td>', 'background distracting from strong images', '2003-03-20 09:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(242050, 15122, 7190, '<td valign="top"><br/>wish grass more in focus</td>', 'wish grass more in focus', '2003-03-20 09:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(242051, 14963, 7190, '<td valign="top">clever</td>', 'clever', '2003-03-20 09:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(242092, 15039, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very good try, focus looks a little soft and the shadow on the left is a bit distracting but i`ve tried this sort of shot and it is quite tricky to get everything right at the same time. If jacko had taken this i think he would have nailed it.7</td>', 'Very good try, focus looks a little soft and the shadow on the left is a bit distracting but i`ve tried this sort of shot and it is quite tricky to get everything right at the same time. If jacko had taken this i think he would have nailed it.7', '2003-03-20 11:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(242099, 15022, 1379, '<td valign="top">Incredible macro!  Love that detail!</td>', 'Incredible macro!  Love that detail!', '2003-03-20 11:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(242100, 15006, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a moving photograph of this creation.  Very sad.</td>', 'What a moving photograph of this creation.  Very sad.', '2003-03-20 11:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(242157, 15148, 7358, '<td valign="top">a very dulh picture</td>', 'a very dulh picture', '2003-03-20 12:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(242201, 14988, 6458, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition on this shot. It meets the challenge and is a good shot. But it leaves me feeling cold for some reason.. Plus I end up thinking of a line from a song "If I had a million dollars, I''d buy you a green dress, but not real green dress - that''s cruel!".  (Yes.. I know it''s more of a suit, yes.. I know I''m wierd.)  7 for a good picture nonetheless!</td>', 'I really like the composition on this shot. It meets the challenge and is a good shot. But it leaves me feeling cold for some reason.. Plus I end up thinking of a line from a song "If I had a million dollars, I''d buy you a green dress, but not real green dress - that''s cruel!".  (Yes.. I know it''s more of a suit, yes.. I know I''m wierd.)  7 for a good picture nonetheless!', '2003-03-20 13:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(242203, 15007, 6458, '<td valign="top">Pretty doll! I like the contrast between the reds and the greens.. Overall, I would have like to have seen more action, something to generate more interest it the photo. As it stands now it''s a picture of a doll.. it seems like there should be something more there. 6 for a good picture which meets the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty doll! I like the contrast between the reds and the greens.. Overall, I would have like to have seen more action, something to generate more interest it the photo. As it stands now it''s a picture of a doll.. it seems like there should be something more there. 6 for a good picture which meets the challenge.', '2003-03-20 13:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(242205, 15127, 6458, '<td valign="top">Nothing like a little photoshop work to increase interest in a photo. Good use of the contrasting colors and composition. I like the negative space, it makes it more than just a photo of a (green) bagel. 6</td>', 'Nothing like a little photoshop work to increase interest in a photo. Good use of the contrasting colors and composition. I like the negative space, it makes it more than just a photo of a (green) bagel. 6', '2003-03-20 13:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(242208, 14983, 6458, '<td valign="top">This is just an excellent macro shot. I like the detail and the colors you''ve managed to capture on the grass. The one detracting point is the out of focus blade in the foreground. However, the combination of the two diagonal blades makes this a more powerful photo, so I can overlook the bluriness. 9</td>', 'This is just an excellent macro shot. I like the detail and the colors you''ve managed to capture on the grass. The one detracting point is the out of focus blade in the foreground. However, the combination of the two diagonal blades makes this a more powerful photo, so I can overlook the bluriness. 9', '2003-03-20 13:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(242209, 14992, 6458, '<td valign="top">I like the effort that has gone into this photo. The lighting is great, though I feel the border is a bit overbearing. Having the small green border so close to the peace symbol makes it feel a bit constrained, though the large black border on the outside mitigates the effect to some extent. <br/>Otherwise, it''s a great shot with a good message and perfect/amusing title. 8</td>', 'I like the effort that has gone into this photo. The lighting is great, though I feel the border is a bit overbearing. Having the small green border so close to the peace symbol makes it feel a bit constrained, though the large black border on the outside mitigates the effect to some extent. Otherwise, it''s a great shot with a good message and perfect/amusing title. 8', '2003-03-20 13:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(242211, 15012, 6458, '<td valign="top">I like this photo alot. It''s simple, yet somehow exciting. The combination of the main diagonal and the horizontal and vertical veins create a pleasing pattern to the eye. The color of the border compliments the leaf, though at times it runs into picture - I personally like my borders to stand out from the picture a little bit. It meets the challenge well. 8</td>', 'I like this photo alot. It''s simple, yet somehow exciting. The combination of the main diagonal and the horizontal and vertical veins create a pleasing pattern to the eye. The color of the border compliments the leaf, though at times it runs into picture - I personally like my borders to stand out from the picture a little bit. It meets the challenge well. 8', '2003-03-20 13:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(242214, 15149, 6458, '<td valign="top">The first picture I scored, and one of my 4 faves for this challenge. Composition is exciting for an abstract photo - I like the interplay of the slight curves and the straight lines - the lighting is good, a few hotspots here and there, but nothing overly distracting - at points they even help highlight the texture of the umbrella. The border is not overbearing and well thought out. Overall - 8</td>', 'The first picture I scored, and one of my 4 faves for this challenge. Composition is exciting for an abstract photo - I like the interplay of the slight curves and the straight lines - the lighting is good, a few hotspots here and there, but nothing overly distracting - at points they even help highlight the texture of the umbrella. The border is not overbearing and well thought out. Overall - 8', '2003-03-20 14:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(242254, 14988, 4494, '<td valign="top">Oh man, the green is over-welming to me.  Too much of it.  I like the little bit of cleavage (sp?) showing however. :D</td>', 'Oh man, the green is over-welming to me.  Too much of it.  I like the little bit of cleavage (sp?) showing however. :D', '2003-03-20 15:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(242273, 15034, 714, '<td valign="top">I have to know what you used for this background.  Where did you find such a big piece of material?</td>', 'I have to know what you used for this background.  Where did you find such a big piece of material?', '2003-03-20 15:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(242364, 15039, 5044, '<td valign="top">LOL, LOL, LOLLLLLLLL.!<br/>Jacko you crack me up. If it''s not you, you''re pretty funny, whoever you are.<br/>Great shot!</td>', 'LOL, LOL, LOLLLLLLLL.!Jacko you crack me up. If it''s not you, you''re pretty funny, whoever you are.Great shot!', '2003-03-20 17:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(242410, 14984, 2178, '<td valign="top">Great color, and setup. Like how its fades to black.</td>', 'Great color, and setup. Like how its fades to black.', '2003-03-20 20:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
