(242553, 15122, 6458, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. for me, the subject of the photo was the golfer. The golfer wants to get to the green, thus has "green on the mind".  This was a fantastically clever shot spiderman, but I''ve found that many people don''t take that into account. I scored this highly, but am not surprised it ended up down here. Better luck nexttime!</td>', 'Hmmm. for me, the subject of the photo was the golfer. The golfer wants to get to the green, thus has "green on the mind".  This was a fantastically clever shot spiderman, but I''ve found that many people don''t take that into account. I scored this highly, but am not surprised it ended up down here. Better luck nexttime!', '2003-03-21 02:50:56.000000', NULL, 0),
