(246368, 15139, 1647, '<td valign="top">Hi - you asked for some critiqing of your photo''s...  Unfortunately the first thing that grabbed my attention is the border.  It''s perhaps a little too bright, and maybe a fine black line between it and the image would help.<br/> <br/>There is a lot of noise in the background.  I suspect you didn''t really have enough light for this.  You could try noise reduction in photoshop, or similar, but I would aim for more light if possible.  I''ve used very bright lights and held lace up around the object to create a soft even light cheaply.</td>', 'Hi - you asked for some critiqing of your photo''s...  Unfortunately the first thing that grabbed my attention is the border.  It''s perhaps a little too bright, and maybe a fine black line between it and the image would help. There is a lot of noise in the background.  I suspect you didn''t really have enough light for this.  You could try noise reduction in photoshop, or similar, but I would aim for more light if possible.  I''ve used very bright lights and held lace up around the object to create a soft even light cheaply.', '2003-03-25 22:21:37.000000', NULL, 0),
